\newlabel{fig:mc_hist}{{7}{15}{Monte Carlo statistical analysis ($N = 200$). (a) Capture time distribution (median 13.4~h, 195 captured trials). (b) Final miss distance distribution for captured trials. (c) Total $\Delta V$ distribution (median 8.86~km/s, P95 19.4~km/s)}{figure.7}{}}
